    "text": "Alvin Walaszek | Lack & Sons Funeral Home\nAlvin Walaszek | Lack & Sons Funeral Home\nA huge Chicago Bears fan and an avid fisherman, Alvin will be remembered for his passion for sports and the outdoors. Visitation for Alvin Walaszek will be held on Tuesday at Lack and Sons Funeral Home, with a funeral service on Wednesday leading to interment at Resurrection Cemetery. Alvin Walaszek will be deeply missed by his family and all who knew him.\nClick here to read the original obituary.",
